---
import CaseStudyHero from './CaseStudyHero.astro';
import BeforeAfter from './BeforeAfter.astro';
import PageRail from './PageRail.astro';
import Img from './Img.astro';
import LVSImage from './LVSImage.astro';
import CaseHeroMockup from './CaseHeroMockup.astro';
import type { Case } from '../data/site';
interface Props { study: Case }
const { study } = Astro.props;
const carla = study.slug === 'carla-funk-photography';
const engagementTitle = study.slug === 'ballad-health' ? 'A merger.\nThousands of pages.' : study.slug === 'meade-tractor' ? 'Local search.\nEnterprise scale.' : 'National search.\nEnterprise scale.';
const concepts = [['heirloom','Heirloom'],['modern-muse','Modern Muse'],['blue-ridge','Blue Ridge']];
---
<article class="material-case">
  <CaseStudyHero study={study} eyebrow={carla ? "Current client / Website" : "Past client / SEO"} href={carla ? "#website" : "#case-content"} action={carla ? "Explore the website" : "Explore the engagement"} caption={carla ? "Existing website · One-year upgrade in progress" : study.scope} />
  <PageRail path={'/work/'+study.slug+'/'} title={study.title} />
  <section class="section wrap" id="case-content"><div class="intro-grid"><div><p class="kick">The engagement</p><h2 class="disp">{carla ? 'A year in.\nA new chapter.' : engagementTitle}</h2></div><div><p>{study.situation}</p><dl><div><dt>Scope</dt><dd>{study.scope}</dd></div><div><dt>Status</dt><dd>{study.timeline}</dd></div></dl><a class="arrow" href={study.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{carla ? 'Visit the existing website' : 'Visit '+study.title} ↗</a></div></div></section>
  {carla && <>
    <section class="section white" id="website" data-case-pages="carla-funk-photography"><div class="wrap"><p class="kick">01 / Existing website · Built by ZINC in 2025</p><h2 class="disp">Her photography, online.</h2><p>The existing website brings Carla’s portfolio, services, story and contact information together. These captures show the live site before the one-year upgrade.</p><div class="website-art"><CaseHeroMockup study={study} loading="lazy" /></div></div></section>
    <section class="section wrap" id="upgrade"><p class="kick">02 / One-year upgrade · In progress</p><h2 class="disp">The next direction.</h2><p>The design review explores three visual directions for the next version of Carla’s website. These are upgrade concepts, with desktop and mobile layouts shown together.</p><a class="arrow" href="https://carla-funk-design-review.zinc160262.chatgpt.site/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Explore the upgrade design review ↗</a><BeforeAfter before="carla-home-desktop" after="carla-upgrade-heirloom" beforeName="Existing" afterName="Concept" beforeLabel="Existing · 2025" afterLabel="Heirloom · Concept" beforeAlt="Carla Funk live website built by ZINC in 2025" afterAlt="Heirloom desktop design concept for Carla Funk’s one-year upgrade" aspectRatio="1440 / 1000" afterCrop={{left:48,top:254,width:1100}}>Existing website compared with the Heirloom concept. The upgrade is in progress; three directions are shown below.</BeforeAfter><div class="concept-grid">{concepts.map(([key,label])=><figure><LVSImage k={'carla-upgrade-'+key} alt={label+' website upgrade concept for Carla Funk, with desktop and mobile designs'} sizes="(max-width: 800px) 90vw, 30vw"/><figcaption>{label} / Design concept · In progress</figcaption></figure>)}</div></section>
    <section class="section white" id="image-manager"><div class="wrap intro-grid"><div><p class="kick">03 / Admin image uploader · In progress</p><h2 class="disp">Her portfolio.<br/>In her hands.</h2><p>The upgrade includes a private admin image uploader so Carla can add photographs and manage her portfolio herself.</p><p>The portfolio-studio design shows the proposed upload and gallery-management experience as part of the upgrade in progress.</p></div><figure><LVSImage k="carla-upgrade-portfolio-manager" alt="Carla Funk portfolio studio design concept with private image uploads and gallery management" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 90vw, 48vw"/><figcaption>Portfolio studio / Design concept · In progress</figcaption></figure></div></section>
    <section class="section wrap" id="identity"><p class="kick">04 / Brand material</p><h2 class="disp">The name behind the work.</h2><div class="identity-grid"><figure class="portrait"><Img k="carla-portrait" alt="Carla Funk holding her camera" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 90vw, 350px"/><figcaption>Carla Funk / Photographer</figcaption></figure><div class="logo-stack">{[['carla-logo','Existing website wordmark'],['carla-logo-heart','Wordmark concept with pink heart'],['carla-logo-white','White wordmark variation'],['carla-shutter','Shutter and heart mark']].map(([key,label])=><figure class:list={['logo',{dark:key==='carla-logo-white',mixed:key==='carla-shutter'}]}><Img k={key} alt={'Carla Funk Photography — '+label} sizes="(max-width: 800px) 85vw, 700px"/><figcaption>{label}</figcaption></figure>)}</div></div></section>
  </>}
  <footer class="wrap closing"><a class="arrow" href="/work/">← Explore more work</a></footer>
</article>
<style>
.material-case{--ink:#181a1c;--muted:#555;--line:#d2d2d0;--bg:#f2f1ee;--bg2:#fff;--pn:#fff;--tealt:#007f83;background:#f2f1ee;color:#181a1c}.zn-page-hero{padding:70px 0;background:#111416;color:#fff}.intro-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}h1{font-size:clamp(58px,7vw,110px);line-height:1;overflow-wrap:break-word;margin:24px 0}h1 span{color:#14b6bb}.lede{font-size:clamp(22px,2.3vw,32px);line-height:1.4}.hero-art{min-width:0;background:white;padding:20px}.hero-art> :global(img),.hero-art> :global(picture)> :global(img){width:100%;height:auto;max-height:440px;object-fit:contain}.kick,dt,figcaption{font:11px/1.7 var(--fm)}.section{padding-block:65px;scroll-margin-top:90px}.section h2{font-size:clamp(42px,5vw,72px);line-height:1.05;white-space:pre-line;margin:22px 0}.section p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;max-width:62ch}.white{background:white}.website-art{max-width:1000px;margin:30px auto 0}.concept-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:24px;margin-top:35px;align-items:start}figure{margin:0;min-width:0}figcaption{padding-top:14px;color:#555}.concept-grid figure{background:white;border:1px solid #ddd;padding:16px}.identity-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;gap:35px;align-items:start}.portrait :global(img){width:100%;height:auto}.logo-stack{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.logo{padding:24px;background:white;border:1px solid #ddd}.logo :global(img){width:100%;height:150px;object-fit:contain}.logo.dark{background:#181a1c}.logo.mixed{background:#888}.logo.mixed figcaption{color:#111}.logo.dark figcaption{color:#ddd}dl{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:25px;border-top:1px solid #ccc;margin:25px 0;padding-top:25px}dd{margin:8px 0 0;line-height:1.6}.closing{padding-block:35px;border-top:1px solid #ccc}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #00898d;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:800px){.intro-grid,.identity-grid,.concept-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}.zn-page-hero{padding:45px 0}.section{padding-block:45px}.hero-art{padding:10px}.logo-stack{grid-template-columns:1fr}.portrait{max-width:400px}.section p{font-size:17px}}
</style>
